### Get all shipments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipments

###

### Create a shipment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "TRK1001",
  "senderName": "Ravi",
  "receiverName": "Priya",
  "deliveryAddress": "Chennai",
  "status": "IN_TRANSIT"
}